Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.62,0:02:04.12,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,400)\be1\1c&H00DF9535\3c&H00F0D9C3}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:07.66,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(400,500)\be1\1c&H0010431E\3c&H0042BC70}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:14.09,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00607BAE\3c&H007EB7D6}在那牽繫在一起的雙手間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:20.73,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00AB969E\3c&H00C9C1C1}若能尋覓到那小小的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:27.45,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H006177B8\3c&H00C9ACB1}在光芒中搖曳著的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:33.51,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H000E1312\3c&H00A8B0B0}所有話語和思念
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:46.55,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00566060\3c&H00C5E5F0}都必將 毫無保留地 傳遞給 身在遠方的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:53.65,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,1000)\be1\1c&H00617EB1\3c&H00BDBBEF}都必將 毫無保留地 傳遞給 身在遠方的你
